# lever-bank row pitch for add8, in blocks. Measured on this recipe:
#   10 -> 46,502 blocks, lever row z 3..153 (10 apart)
#    6 -> 45,542 blocks, z 3..93
#    4 -> 45,062 blocks, z 3..63
#    2 -> 44,634 blocks, z 3..33   <-- this file: dual-engine PASS,
#                                      0/610,816 dust cells over 32 vectors
#    1 -> STITCH RED (wire B0 touches A0: adjacent lever cells share dust)
# alu4 is RED at 2, so this is a per-recipe pin, not a new default.
2
